* 区域通用标题 */\n.section-head {border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brick-red);padding-bottom: 8px;margin: 48px 0 20px;display: flex;align-items: baseline;justify-content: space-between}\n.section-head h2 {font-size: 20px;color: var(--brick-dark);letter-spacing: -0.01em}\n.section-head .section-note {font-size: 12px;color: var(--text-muted);font-family: ui-monospace, monospace}\n\n/* 虚线框票据风格卡片 (card: 6) 与纵向列表逐行展开 (plans_view: 2) */\n.plans-vertical-list {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 16px}\n.plan-ticket {background: var(--panel-bg);border: 1px dashed var(--ticket-border);padding: 20px 24px;position: relative}\n.plan-ticket.featured {background: #fff;border: 1px dashed var(--brick-red);box-shadow: inset 4px 0 0 var(--brick-red)}\n.ticket-badge {position: absolute;top: 12px;right: 16px;font-size: 11px;padding: 2px 8px;background: var(--brick-red);color: #fff;font-weight: 600;text-transform: uppercase}\n.plan-row-main {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 220px 180px 1fr;align-items: start;gap: 20px}\n.plan-name-block h3 {font-size: 18px;color: var(--text-main);margin-bottom: 4px}\n.plan-code {font-size: 12px;color: var(--text-muted);font-family: monospace}\n.plan-price-block {border-left: 1px dashed var(--border-line);padding-left: 16px}\n.plan-price {font-size: 22px;font-weight: 700;color: var(--brick-red)}\n.plan-annual {font-size: 12px;color: var(--text-muted);margin-top: 2px}\n.plan-features-block ul {list-style: none;display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));gap: 6px 12px}\n.plan-features-block li {font-size: 13px;color: var(--text-main);position: relative;padding-left: 14px}\n.plan-features-block li::before {content: \"-\";position: absolute;left: 0;color: var(--brick-red);font-weight: bold}\n\n/* 客户端配置说明与流程 */\n.config-guide-grid {display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);gap: 16px}\n.guide-card {background: var(--panel-bg);border: 1px dashed var(--ticket-border);padding: 18px}\n.guide-card h3 {font-size: 15px;margin-bottom: 10px;color: var(--brick-dark)}\n.guide-card ol {padding-left: 18px;font-size: 13px;color: var(--text-main)}\n.guide-card li {margin-bottom: 6px}\n\n/* 编号列表常见问题 (faq_view: 2) */\n.faq-list {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 12px}\n.faq-item {background: var(--panel-bg);border: 1px dashed var(--ticket-border);padding: 16px 20px;display: grid;grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr;align-items: baseline}\n.faq-index {font-size: 16px;font-weight: 800;color: var(--brick-red);font-family: monospace}\n.faq-content h3 {font-size: 15px;color: var(--brick-dark);margin-bottom: 6px}\n.faq-content p {font-size: 13px;color: var(--text-main);line-height: 1.6}\n\n/* 页脚 */\n.page-footer {margin-top: 60px;padding-top: 20px;border-top: 1px dashed var(--ticket-border);display: flex;justify-content: space-between;font-size: 12px;color: var(--text-muted);font-family: monospace}\n.footer-nav {display: flex;gap: 14px}\n\n@media (max-width: 820px) {\n  .hero-dashboard {grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr}\n  .hero-title-tile {grid-column: span 2}\n  .hero-tag-tile {grid-column: span 2}\n  .hero-stat-1, .hero-stat-2, .hero-stat-3, .hero-stat-4 {grid-column: span 1}\n  .plan-row-main {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 12px}\n  .plan-price-block {border-left: none;border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-line);padding-left: 0;padding-top: 10px}\n  .config-guide-grid {grid-template-columns: 1fr}\n  .faq-item {grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr}\n}\n</style><main>\n  \n  <section class=\"hero-dashboard\" id=\"overview\">\n    <div class=\"hero-tile hero-title-tile\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">SYSTEM SPECIFICATION / 接入说明</div>\n      <h1>网抑云 网络节点配额与路由控制</h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-desc\">本页面汇总网抑云全线可用接入计划、月度流量分配额度、并发设备限制及跨平台客户端通用接入参数清单。</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-quick-links\">\n        <a href=\"#plans\">查看可用套餐清单 ↓</a>\n        <a href=\"#clients\">读取客户端对接说明 ↓</a>\n        <a href=\"#faq\">查询运行常见问题 ↓</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-tile hero-tag-tile\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"kicker\">STATUS / 调度状态</div>\n        <div>线路调度运行中</div>\n        <div>支持标准订阅 URL 及全协议客户端同步导入</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        数据版本：2025-V1\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-tile hero-stat-1\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">100G+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-caption\">基准月度起始流量</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-tile hero-stat-2\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">3~20</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-caption\">多设备并行许可范围</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-tile hero-stat-3\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">IPLC</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-caption\">核心专线传输通道备选</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-tile hero-stat-4\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">24/7</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-caption\">工单响应支持</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"plans\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <h2>01 / 接入配额与套餐明细</h2>\n      <span class=\"section-note\">SUBSCRIPTION PLANS</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"plans-vertical-list\">\n      <article class=\"plan-ticket\">\n        <div class=\"plan-row-main\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name-block\">\n            <h3>基础版</h3>\n            <div class=\"plan-code\">REF: NET-BASE-01</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price-block\">\n            <div class=\"plan-price\">¥15/月</div>\n            <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-features-block\">\n            <ul>\n              <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n              <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n              <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n              <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-ticket featured\">\n        <span class=\"ticket-badge\">推荐配置</span>\n        <div class=\"plan-row-main\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name-block\">\n            <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n            <div class=\"plan-code\">REF: NET-FLAGSHIP-02</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price-block\">\n            <div class=\"plan-price\">¥35/月</div>\n            <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-features-block\">\n            <ul>\n              <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n              <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n              <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n              <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n              <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-ticket\">\n        <div class=\"plan-row-main\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name-block\">\n            <h3>团队版</h3>\n            <div class=\"plan-code\">REF: NET-TEAM-03</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price-block\">\n            <div class=\"plan-price\">¥85/月</div>\n            <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-features-block\">\n            <ul>\n              <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n              <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n              <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n              <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n              <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"clients\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <h2>02 / 客户端接入与同步步骤</h2>\n      <span class=\"section-note\">CLIENT SETUP INSTRUCTIONS</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"config-guide-grid\">\n      <div class=\"guide-card\">\n        <h3>桌面平台 (Windows / macOS)</h3>\n        <ol>\n          <li>获取个人中心生成的订阅 URL。</li>\n          <li>在对应客户端中新建订阅并粘贴完整链接。</li>\n          <li>执行节点解析，更新本地缓存文件。</li>\n          <li>在策略组中选取延迟最低的可用接入点。</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"guide-card\">\n        <h3>移动设备 (iOS / Android)</h3>\n        <ol>\n          <li>使用支持全协议配置文件的移动端工具。</li>\n          <li>通过扫描二维码或长按导入配置文本。</li>\n          <li>启用系统网络权限并验证本地路由回路。</li>\n          <li>分流规则建议选用规则模式而非全局模式。</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"guide-card\">\n        <h3>路由及网关设备</h3>\n        <ol>\n          <li>下载由网抑云后台导出的 YAML 或 JSON 格式原始配置。</li>\n          <li>上传至网关系统指定配置存储路径。</li>\n          <li>设定定时重启 Cron 任务以按周期拉取新节点池。</li>\n          <li>监控并发请求数量，避免超出套餐设备上限。</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <h2>03 / 常见技术与计费问题</h2>\n      <span class=\"section-note\">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-index\">#01</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3>设备同时在线数是如何计算的？</h3>\n          <p>系统按当前正在建立长连接通信的独立 IP 与设备标识符进行统计。若基础版超出 3 台设备、旗舰版超出 5 台设备或团队版超出 20 台设备，后接入的终端将收到网络握手中断限制，直至旧连接释放。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-index\">#02</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3>每月配额流量重置周期如何计算？</h3>\n          <p>流量并非自然月 1 号统一清零，而是根据订单首次激活日期的对应时间戳每 30 天自动重置一次。当月未使用完毕的剩余流量不支持累加至下个账期。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-index\">#03</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3>流媒体解锁与普通节点池有何区别？</h3>\n          <p>基础版配备的普通线路节点池适用于常规网页浏览及基础流媒体；旗舰版及团队版包含的原生流媒体解锁线路针对区域性版权库提供定制出口标识，支持更高码率的视频流传输。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-index\">#04</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3>订阅链接拉取失败应排查哪些环节？</h3>\n          <p>首先核对本地客户端是否启用了系统代理干扰订阅请求；其次确认本地 DNS 是否正确解析订阅域名；若仍无法更新，请登录网抑云控制台手动复制单节点节点代码导入测试。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"page-footer\">\n    <div>网抑云 DOCUMENTATION &amp; REGISTRY - NO RESERVED RIGHTS RESERVED</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-nav\">\n      <a href=\"#overview\">返回顶部 ↑</a>\n      <a href=\"#plans\">套餐清单</a>\n      <a href=\"#clients\">客户端指引</a>\n      <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</main>",
